	@{ \extracolsep{0pt}} l @{\extracolsep{\fill}} r}
	then & $4ck + \Sum{i=1}{p} 4c k_i (1 + \log_2 k_i)$ & $\leq$ & $4ck + 4ck + 4c \, \f{k \log_2(k) - k}{k-2}
	(k-p)$ &\\
		  & & $\leq$ & $4ck + 4ck + 4c (k \log_2(k) - k)$ & since $p \geq 2$\\
