arXiv id: 2212.14814
url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.14814
title: A quasi-quadratic vertex Kernel for Cograph edge editing
categories: cs.DS cs.CC

Prior triage (a hypothesis, not ground truth - verify it against the paper):
  family: graph structures
  method: planted solution
