codex
The stricter canonical-language experiment exposed an important tradeoff: it changed the rendered contract and generator after the oracle evidence, and its first version was not equivariant under relabeling. I’m reverting to the exact module snapshot the clean oracle actually saw. The final README will explicitly caveat that G4 samples the declared six-anchor syntax, not the much stronger prior conditioned on already discovering a nested contrast chain.
